gJv(){return"Unfortunately, no beaches were found for your query. Try changing the search area by tapping the button at the top of the screen."},
gH_(){return"P.S. Our beach database is constantly being updated. It is possible that a beach you know has not yet been added. We would be grateful if you could provide us with information about any missing beach."},
