gGs(){return"About"},
gKa(){return"Privacy Policy"},
gJe(){return"Last updated: "},
gJ5(){return"Introduction"},
gK8(){return"Playas provides information about beaches, weather and flags. No registration or sign-in is required. The app uses external services for maps, locating the search area and advertising; they process the data described below."},
gHV(){return"Data Collection"},
gHU(){return"With your permission, the app accesses the device location to find nearby beaches while you use the app. Background location is not requested. The selected search area and preferences are saved locally on the device; the app does not keep a movement history. Coordinates of the selected area may be sent to our server and Google geocoding to determine the place name. api.country.is and IP2Location, via our server, are used to estimate location from an IP address.\n\nGoogle Maps and Google Mobile Ads (AdMob) may automatically collect IP addresses, device and SDK identifiers (including advertising ID and app set ID), device information, map and ad interactions, and diagnostic, crash and performance information. An IP address may be used to estimate approximate location. These data are processed to provide maps, serve and measure ads, perform analytics, improve services and prevent fraud."},
gHX(){return"Data Sharing"},
gHW(){return"Data are sent to the providers of the relevant services: Google (Maps, AdMob, Firebase), api.country.is and IP2Location. Their processing and retention of data are governed by their policies: https://policies.google.com/privacy , https://country.is/ and https://www.ip2location.com/privacy-policy . If you choose to send a support message, we receive its text, your email address and any diagnostic information you attach to respond to your request."},
gDt(){return"Security and data controls"},
gDs(){return"The app uses HTTPS for network requests; Google states that Mobile Ads data are encrypted in transit using TLS. You can revoke location permission and reset or delete the advertising ID in Android settings. You can remove local preferences and the saved search area by clearing the app data. The providers explain controls for the data they process in their policies. Questions about data and requests to delete information sent to support can be addressed to ok.ai11.link@gmail.com."},
gK2(){return"Changes to This Policy"},
gK1(){return"This policy may be updated when the app or its services change. The current version is published on this page."},
gHy(){return"Contact"},
gHx(){return"If you have any questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at:"},
