gGv(){return"Huge thanks to the creators of the following software that made this application possible:"},
gGw(){return"\u2022 Language: Dart\n\u2022 SDK: Flutter\n\u2022 DevTools: FlutterFlow, GitHub\n\u2022 Backend services: Firebase\n\u2022 And many other amazing packages"},
