gGN(){return"By using Playas, you agree to use the app lawfully and at your own risk. Beach conditions can change quickly, so always follow official local safety guidance and warning signs. The app content is provided as-is and may be updated without prior notice."},
gAK(){return"Beach details will be added in future app updates"},
